00:04:02.991 --> 00:04:03.740
MARK MANDEL: Nice.

00:04:03.740 --> 00:04:04.160
MELANIE WARRICK: Great.

00:04:04.160 --> 00:04:04.702
Sara.

00:04:04.702 --> 00:04:05.660
SARA ROBINSON: Awesome.

00:04:05.660 --> 00:04:07.130
I'm on the same team as Amy.

00:04:07.130 --> 00:04:09.770
We're focused on big data
and machine learning.

00:04:09.770 --> 00:04:12.560
I come from more of a
