PhD in machine learning,

00:19:51.940 --> 00:19:54.460
I can still work out like how
accurate my predictions are

00:19:54.460 --> 00:19:57.370
and see where my data set may
be failing just through the web

00:19:57.370 --> 00:19:59.730
UI that's kind of
just given to me.

00:19:59.730 --> 00:20:01.630
AMY UNRUH: Yeah, or
