little thumbnails, things

00:20:11.290 --> 00:20:13.850
like the false positives,
the false negatives,

00:20:13.850 --> 00:20:15.550
the true positives, et cetera.

00:20:15.550 --> 00:20:18.670
So you can just sort of
scan for a given category--

00:20:18.670 --> 00:20:21.700
again, where the categories are
things like sheltered scarps--

00:20:21.700 --> 00:20:22.867
and see how well it's doing.

00:20:22.867 --> 00:20:25.241
SARA ROBINSON: Yeah, one other
thing that you reminded me

00:20:25.241 --> 00:20:27.130
