percentage of your photos

00:20:33.010 --> 00:20:34.730
were correctly
identified as that label.

00:20:34.730 --> 00:20:38.170
So in my case, I could see that
maybe 80% of my cumulus clouds

00:20:38.170 --> 00:20:40.810
were being correctly
identified as cumulus,

00:20:40.810 --> 00:20:43.390
but maybe 20% of them
